<div class="flags">
<div>Sales per store, the 2011–2013 gross margins and advertising as a share of sales are our calculations from reported totals.</div>
<div>1995–1998 sales and earnings are Tandy Corporation’s, which still included other chains, so they aren’t comparable with later years.</div>
<div>The 2013 10-K restated 2009–2012 sales. We use the restated figures for those years and first-reported figures before 2009.</div>
<div>We don’t have a sourced share price for 2014, or a reliable count of RadioShack-branded stores after April 2015.</div>
<div>Facts about rivals marked “general knowledge” and the TRS-80’s launch year are not from the sources listed here.</div>
<div>Weights in the cause-of-death section and all what-if text are editorial judgment.</div>
